glyphwave re-implements, in its own code, algorithms and effect designs from
the following MIT-licensed projects. No source code was translated or
copied; the text effects do reuse terminaltexteffects' default colour
palettes, glyph sequences, katakana symbol list and per-effect timing
constants, and docs/cava-tte-algorithms.md describes cava's spectrum code
in pseudocode derived from its source. Their notices are kept here.

